  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-date">Week 1 — Research</div><div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-role">Medical Content Research</div><div class="tl-org">Kalyani Kidney Care Centre, Erode</div><div class="tl-body">Worked with medical professionals to understand kidney health topics — kidney stones, dialysis, transplants, and preventive care. Developed a visual language that communicates medical facts without being intimidating.</div><div class="tl-badges"><span class="tl-badge">Medical Research</span><span class="tl-badge">Content Strategy</span></div></div></div>
    <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-dot"></div><div class="tl-date">Week 2-3 — Design</div><div class="tl-card"><div class="tl-role">Infographic &amp; Creative Design</div><div class="tl-org">Social Media Campaigns</div><div class="tl-body">Designed data-driven infographics, illustrated awareness posts and promotional creatives. Used a cool blue and navy palette aligned with the medical brand, with clear data visualisation for health statistics.</div><div class="tl-badges"><span class="tl-badge">Photoshop</span><span class="tl-badge">Illustrator</span><span class="tl-badge">Canva Pro</span></div></div></div>
